---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { products } from '../data.js';
---
<Base title="Recycled plastic flakes | Bukjum Marketplace" description="Browse indicative prices for bagged, unwashed PET, HDPE and PP flakes and request a wholesale quotation.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">BUKJUM MARKETPLACE</p><h1>Recycled flakes,<br /><em>clearly described.</em></h1><p>Review current indicative ranges and processing details for wholesale and industrial enquiries.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CURRENT CATALOGUE</p><h2>Choose your<br /><em>material.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/request/">Request a quote <span>→</span></a></div><div class="product-grid">{products.map((p, i) => <a class={`product-card ${p.color}`} href={`/request/?material=${p.slug}`}><div class="card-top"><span class="product-index">0{i + 1} / MATERIAL</span><span class="arrow-circle">↗</span></div><div class="flake-art" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><h3>{p.name}</h3><p>{p.resin}</p><p class="catalogue-summary">{p.summary}</p><div class="card-bottom"><span class="price">{p.price}<small> / tonne · indicative</small></span><span class="card-arrow">→</span></div></a>)}</div><div class="notice-box"><strong>Condition and quotation</strong><p>Flakes are collected, sorted and crushed but not washed before crushing. They are sold in bags; buyers should carry out additional cleaning. Minimum order is 10 tonnes. Prices, product sizes, availability and delivery are confirmed by quotation.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="capacity-band"><div class="container capacity-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">FOUNDING SUPPLIER</p><h2>Built around bulk<br />supply enquiries.</h2></div><div class="capacity-copy"><p>Combined production capacity is at least 50 tonnes per month across PET, HDPE and PP. PP is approximately 90% of current output. Production is continuous.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="/request/">Request a quotation <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="capacity-number"><strong>10<span>t</span></strong><small>MINIMUM<br />ORDER</small></div></div></section>
  <section class="section video-section"><div class="container video-grid"><div class="video-frame"><video controls playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/images/recycling-materials-poster.jpg" aria-label="Supplier-supplied video showing bagged material and surrounding work area"><source src="/videos/recycling-materials.mp4" type="video/mp4" />Your browser does not support embedded video.</video></div><div class="video-copy"><p class="eyebrow">SUPPLIER-SUPPLIED FOOTAGE</p><h2>Bagged materials<br /><em>and the work area.</em></h2><p class="body-copy">The video shows bagged material and the surrounding work area. It is provided for context and does not certify product grade or cleanliness.</p><p class="price-note">Video: portrait, 360 × 640 · about 1 minute 35 seconds.</p></div></div></section>
</Base>

